Subject: [PATCH] [trivial] alsa: Fix typos in alsa-driver-api.xml
Date: Sun,  9 Feb 2014 00:47:36 +0900
Message-Id: <1391874456-5566-1-git-send-email-standby24x7@gmail.com>
